{"version":1,"key":"card:154","content":{"id":154,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a7207b93-63fe-4f72-8d0a-c217dd62b1a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个元素有可能会被多个选择器选中，并且被应用相同的样式，这种情况我们称之为样式"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"层叠"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"ef852b44-6124-4a6b-98c7-7ff7dac2d69c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4c5c1a4c-d0bc-442f-bd4e-ce7ba4df510b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <title>层叠</title>\n    <style>\n      div {\n        color: green;\n      }\n      .red {\n        color: red;\n      }\n      #box {\n        color: brown;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"red\" id=\"box\" style=\"color: gray\">一段文字</div>\n  </body>\n</html>","collabId":"756142f3-f7d4-420a-a6c9-c469d57d83a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8980f39c-ab42-4bf7-b30a-0d52b8067a4a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述的 div 标签被四个选择器选中，并且同时设置了 color 属性，那么哪个属性会生效呢？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bd7d5ee3-390a-4f65-a0f0-b397b6245046","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这就牵涉到选择器优先级的问题了，优先级大小规则如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"2d588426-405a-4c31-84e8-b51077c95a0a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"56e3338e-e88f-4f4e-be0f-72741b9f8e86","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"行内样式 > id 选择器 > 类选择器、伪类选择器、属性选择器 > 标签选择器","collabId":"e91200b3-620a-43f2-b820-b229cfcad7eb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b9309596-5837-4ef7-82c9-a5fc12007e8c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以上面行内样式会生效，文字颜色显示为 gray 灰色。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"57905995-2db9-4d27-b0dc-0c3b3d198e59","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面明确了单个选择器优先级的排序，但是对于组合选择器，是多个选择器的组合，它们的优先级又是如何? 它会按照如下顺序进行比较："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"d64bc383-0907-4795-85f1-4b1cdb303971","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"775cc9b6-8dd5-4ec8-915d-36a222f925b4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bf1dfef5-a4f6-4f0b-9ab6-6be12f65989f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"id 选择器"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6b3da1ef-be5c-4d01-9c9a-e225e7ae35a9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2bf6c5d7-c127-46d5-bc9d-238c56970efd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类选择器、伪类选择器、属性选择器"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"26042613-0aa4-4a52-bb48-26081b805caa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a4695ad2-774c-4a1e-9150-510e17d9297d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标签选择器"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"830e1da1-f289-4294-bdc2-6c203f9ec738","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先会比较选择器中 id 选择器的个数，个数多的优先级高，如果个数相同，则继续比较类选择器、伪类选择器、属性选择器这三个选择器个数之和的大小，个数多的优先级高；如果还相同，则继续比较标签选择器的个数，个数多的选择器优先级高。如果比对完个数都相同，那么就看定义的顺序，定义在后面的选择器有高的优先级。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"a3d5013b-ace5-4b6d-8f16-b3df2e4e55c4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c791bd94-d15f-442e-8c56-824523bee5b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无论有多少个选择器，行内样式的优先级都比它们高！"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"82845cb9-ba89-44d9-9e27-e3b8d1d9d6a2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在写样式的时候，我们可能会发现写的样式没有生效，排除拼写错误，很有可能是你的选择器优先级不够，这个时候你可能会在选择器上加上其他选择器，例如 id 选择器来提高它的优先级。那还有一种方法就是在样式的末尾加上 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"7cb212f7-57d4-42d1-9942-741089ce4b8b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6f1c24e0-0fe3-4c7a-8574-1e0b4802843f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":".container p {\n  color: red;\n}\np {\n  color: blue;\n}","collabId":"f3e09e11-9886-40ce-93dc-191baf1eb787","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d35b573b-0c9f-4dd4-b81d-b61b8e355517","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面的选择器的优先级没有上面的高，这时我们可以在样式后添加 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"f3d88da1-fee2-4353-8a14-8b9a28e24a80","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9f375b45-03f3-477f-a7d6-374c4995c09f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"p {\n  color: blue !important;\n}","collabId":"6f4e1ff1-d0b1-4763-849a-cdf239dcc47b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"762c401e-fb9b-491d-a104-62a62e56dc88","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以使该条样式无视选择器的优先级，或者说将优先级提升为最高级别，使得被选中的标签使用该样式。"}]}],"tags":["CSS"],"createTime":1690211480204,"updateTime":1743303640405,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640405}}